# Netlify-style fallback. INERT on Vercel — vercel.json is what actually runs.
# Kept only so a move to Netlify doesn't silently lose the routing rules; if you
# change vercel.json, change this too.
#
# Note there is deliberately NO `/* /index.html 200` catch-all: it would make
# every unknown URL return 200 with the homepage's HTML (soft 404s). Unknown
# paths must fall through to 404.html and return a real 404.
/about      /about/index.html      200
/gallery    /gallery/index.html    200
/contact    /contact/index.html    200
/admin      /index.html            200
/admin/*    /index.html            200
/invoice/*  /index.html            200
/*          /404.html              404
